  unitName: Wyvern Wings Klaus
  unitId: 20736
  unitNumber: 1241
  description: An otherworldly god resurrected as a "Mock God" prototype Mock Unit.
    He bent space and time via destruction in order to return to his original world,
    and in doing so led his sworn enemy and their servants to him. Fighting alongside
    Isterio, also resurrected as a Mock God, his new powers allowed him to dominate
    his opponents for a time. However, he was completely destroyed by a weapon of
    mass destruction upgraded by a mysterious scientist. It is said that in the end,
    he cursed the one who called him there and the world itself with all his might.
  summonDesc: That human...must be of my world.<br>Have I lost to the humans<br>of
    your world, too?<br>All I know is ruin...
  fusionDesc: I am growing used to this body...<br>Grh... Meaning that my new body<br>and
    that thing share a common source.
  evoDesc: A "Mock God"? You insult me...<br>Someday, your arrogance<br>will be the
    end of you.
  element: 2
  rarity: 6
